        {
          "id": 799251899,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The CI failure is clearly a false positive; `validate-clang-check.sh` is complaining about `packet-ber.h` and `packet-frame.h` not being present in the directory of the ASN.1 template files, but they're just template files not the final dissectors. (Though why haven't we run into this earlier?)",
