        {
          "id": 800112719,
          "type": null,
          "body": "The tools/validate-clang-check.sh script need to be generalized to skip _all_ template files, not just for ASTERIX.\n\nAn expression like `echo \"$FILE_BASENAME\" | grep -Eq 'packet.*template.c'` could be used for that.\n\nThen this commit be rebased on to that change and successfully clear the pipelines.",
